# Vendored third-party source (see VENDOR.md). Every file in this tree is text
# and is pinned to LF so the committed bytes match MANIFEST.sha256 on every
# platform and every checkout. The repo-root .gitattributes does not pin .inl
# files (RmlUi ships many, e.g. Colour.inl / Element.inl), which would otherwise
# pick up CRLF under core.autocrlf=true and break the hash manifest
# (FtdSourceLint.cmake hashes the on-disk bytes). There are no binary files in
# this subset.
* text eol=lf
